1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:03,830
This janitor died with $8 million. Nobody knew.

2
00:00:03,880 --> 00:00:07,520
Ronald Read pumped gas and cleaned floors in Vermont for decades.

3
00:00:07,570 --> 00:00:11,220
He drove a used car, and held his coat together with safety pins.

4
00:00:11,270 --> 00:00:15,930
But every spare dollar went into stocks he understood. And he never sold.

5
00:00:15,980 --> 00:00:20,390
After he died, his safe deposit box was packed with stock certificates.

6
00:00:20,440 --> 00:00:25,340
He left $4.8 million to the hospital, and $1.2 million to the library.

7
00:00:25,390 --> 00:00:28,620
No genius. No luck. Just time.

8
00:00:28,720 --> 00:00:30,930
So… what's your excuse?
